    "Buddy System  - Bordeaux Montaigne University v1.2\nGo to content\nGo to search\nGo to menu\nBuddy System  - Bordeaux Montaigne University v1.2\nShare\nShare on Facebook\nShare on LinkedIn\nSend by Mail\nYour name\n*\nYour mail\n*\nRecipient(s)\n*\nSeparated by coma\nMessage\nImage's text\n*\nIf the image is not clear enough, you can refresh the page.\nBuddy System\nTandem: Bordeaux Montaigne’s buddy system\nTANDEM\nis an\nonline platform\nwhere international and local students from Bordeaux Montaigne University can register in order to participate in our buddy system.\nThe International Welcome Desk is responsible for coordinating the matching of pairs. When registering on the platform, each student can specify their expectations and preferences, and once the matching process is complete, the students are free to meet and begin the mentoring relationship. It is up to each pair to decide how they wish to work together.\nRegister directly on the\nTANDEM\nplatform\nThe buddy system's objectives\nThe objectives of TANDEM are:\nTo facilitate the integration of international students by offering them personalised support from their peers upon arrival;\nTo promote solidarity among students at Bordeaux Montaigne University by fostering mutual support;\nEncourage exchanges, enabling students at Bordeaux Montaigne University to enjoy an experience of openness and internationalisation within their own institution.\nThe\nInternational Welcome Desk\nwill be there to assist you at every step of the process. Furthermore,\nsocial and cultural events\nare organised throughout the academic year for students taking part in the\nTANDEM\nprogramme.\nMedias\nInstagram\nBluesky\nScoop.it\nYoutube\nLinkedIn\nSoundCloud\nHelp\nAccessibility: non-compliant\nSitemap\nLegal notice\nContact us\nUniversité Bordeaux Montaigne\nBordeaux Montaigne University\nAccess map\nDomaine Universitaire\nF33607 Pessac Cedex\nContact university\nPartners\nfooter-script"
